{"id": "doc_23247176", "source": "https://x.com/Cyberhelp_firm", "type": "article", "title": "Cyberhelp_firm", "text": "Alex_Recovery (@Cyberhelp_firm) / X\nLog in\nSign up\nAlex_Recovery\n644\nposts\nAlex_Recovery\n@Cyberhelp_firm\nPROFESSIONAL CYBER SECURITY\nAll META ACCOUNTS RECOVERY,\nTARGETED INDIVIDUAL, V2k, MIND CONTROL AND LOST FUND'S\nwa.me/message/C2FX5H…\nJoined September 2013\n236\nFollowing\n79\nFollowers\nMention\nFollow\nPosts\nPosts\nReplies\nReplies\nReposts\nReposts\nMedia\nMedia\nPinned\nAlex_Recovery\n@Cyberhelp_firm\nMar 18, 2025\nReplying to\n@MonicaHerv59357\nYou're very welcome! I'm glad I could help. If you can, share your experience with others so they know they’re not alone and that there’s a way forward!\"\n#v2k\n#TargetedIndividual\n#mindcontrol\n1\n1\n6\n472\nAlex_Recovery\n@Cyberhelp_firm\nSep 15, 2025\n#gangstalkingawareness\n#V2K\n#targetedindividuals\n#mindcontrol\n#gangstalkingusa\n#stalking\n59\nAlex_Recovery\n@Cyberhelp_firm\nJul 15, 2025\nI’ve helped many targeted individuals (V2K, MK Ultra, DEW, mind control) block, deactivate, and get removed from watchlists. Some doubt it’s possible — that’s why they’re stuck. Others tried it, and it worked. Still helping more daily.\n📩 DM me 🚀💻👍💯\n#targetedindividuals\n#v2k\n58\nAlex_Recovery\n@Cyberhelp_firm\nMay 8, 2025\nMy mission is to provide a safe and supportive environment where targeted individuals can share their experiences and find resources to help themselves cope.\n#targetedindividuals\n#GangStalkers\n#gangstalking\n#HavanaSyndrome\n#watchlist\n#HomelandSecurity\n#V2K\n#gangstalking\n#V2K\n2\n2\n114\nAlex_Recovery\n@Cyberhelp_firm\nMay 7, 2025\nI'm deeply committed to supporting individuals who are affected by V2K, remote neural monitoring, and related forms of harassment.\n#GangStalkers\n#gangstalking\n#HavanaSyndrome\n#watchlist\n#m\n#V2k\n#targetedindividuals\n#mindcontrol\n#electronicharassment\n#DirectedEnergyWeapons\n1\n2\n99", "metadata": {"category": "mkultra_benchmark", "topic": "mind_control_research"}}
{"id": "doc_00262913", "source": "https://x.com/ennucore/status/1991949868773126361", "type": "article", "title": "1991949868773126361", "text": "Lev Chizhov on X: \"Can ultrasound make you smell things that aren’t there?\nTurns out, yes! We reliably triggered distinct scents like a campfire burn or a garbage truck by targeting our brains with ultrasound. To our knowledge, this has never been done before, even in animals.\nThis may be a promi… / X\nPost\nLog in\nSign up\nPost\nLev Chizhov on X: \"Can ultrasound make you smell things that aren’t there?\nTurns out, yes! We reliably triggered distinct scents like a campfire burn or a garbage truck by targeting our brains with ultrasound. To our knowledge, this has never been done before, even in animals.\nThis may be a promising modality for writing to the brain non-invasively:\n🧵 1/\"\nLev Chizhov\n@levchizhov\nCan ultrasound make you smell things that aren’t there?\nTurns out, yes! We reliably triggered distinct scents like a campfire burn or a garbage truck by targeting our brains with ultrasound. To our knowledge, this has never been done before, even in animals.\nThis may be a promising modality for writing to the brain non-invasively:\n🧵 1/\n00:00\n7:20 PM · Nov 21, 2025\n2.1M\nViews\n245\n581\n4.4K\n2.3K\nLev Chizhov\n@levchizhov\nCan ultrasound make you smell things that aren’t there?\nTurns out, yes! We reliably triggered distinct scents like a campfire burn or a garbage truck by targeting our brains with ultrasound. To our knowledge, this has never been done before, even in animals.\nThis may be a promising modality for writing to the brain non-invasively:\n🧵 1/\n00:00\n7:20 PM · Nov 21, 2025\n2.1M\nViews\n245\n581\n4.4K\n2.3K\nLev Chizhov\n@levchizhov\nNov 21, 2025\nWe built this in just a couple days, using:\n- a hacked-together ultrasound headset (held together with a plastic knife taped to it)\n- Lev’s skull MRI to calculate the ideal location\n- safety testing with a hydrophone (water tank test setup) - notably, the power was incredibly\nShow more\n7\n10\n421\n67K\nLev Chizhov\n@levchizhov\nNov 21, 2025\nWe managed to induce four smells, replicated in two people:\n🌬️ The sensation of fresh air, with a lot of oxygen\n🗑️ The smell of garbage, like few-day-old fruit peels\n🎇 An ozone-like \"electric\" sensation, like you're next to an air ionizer\n🔥 A campfire smell of burning wood\n3/\n10\n4\n425\n49K\nLev Chizhov\n@levchizhov\nNov 21, 2025\nRight after determining the target spots for each scent, we did a blind testing challenge where we selected a random one and Lev had to tell us which scent he smelled.\n4/\n00:00\n4\n7\n280\n67K\nLev Chizhov\n@levchizhov\nNov 21, 2025\nThe system responsible for the perception of smells is interesting beyond aromas. It’s an unfiltered and less processed channel than vision or hearing. It’s also closely connected to brain regions such as the hippocampus, which is why smells bring up such strong memories.\nIt can\nShow more\n4\n10\n289\n35K\nLev Chizhov\n@levchizhov\nNov 21, 2025\nOne could imagine this being useful beyond simulating smells in VR, or even just reviving fainted people. If we run more experiments to gain more fine-grained control, we might get a 400-dimensional channel to rapidly beam information to your brain.\n6/\n7\n12\n304\n38K\nLev Chizhov\n@levchizhov\nNov 21, 2025\nKudos to the team -- Albert\nexr0n.com\n,\n@\nennucore\n,\n@\nthomas_rribeiro\n, and\n@\nyush_g\nfor pulling off this awesome result. We’ve published a full blogpost with our parameters, trials, and exact findings here:\nwritetobrain.com/olfactory\n8\n18\n231\n27K\nLev Chizhov\n@levchizhov\nNov 21, 2025\n@\nDrAllyLouks\n3\n3\n183\n22K\nLev Chizhov\n@levchizhov\nNov 21, 2025\nAlbert made a Twitter,\n@\nexr0n_finally\n1\n1\n22\n21K\nLev Chizhov\n@levchizhov\nNov 24, 2025\nTried it on\n@\nguillefix\nas well\n00:00\n3\n2\n16\n3.2K\nCode_of_Kai\n@Code_of_Kai\nNov 21, 2025\nQuestion: can you elicit the perception of scents that aren't associated with having a stroke?\n2\n1\n167\n16K", "metadata": {"category": "mkultra_benchmark", "topic": "mind_control_research"}}
