ies in Quantum Ph ysics and Neysics and Neysics and Neysics and Neysics and Ne w Science Maw Science Maw Science Maw Science Maw Science Ma y yy yy\nExplain the Existence of PExplain the Existence of PExplain the Existence of PExplain the Existence of PExplain the Existence of P ar arar araranor anoranor anoranor mal Phenomenamal Phenomenamal Phenomenamal Phenomenamal Phenomena\nHigh Praise for Crossfir CrossfirCrossfir CrossfirCrossfir e ee ee\n“Compelling reading. ”\n— —— ——W WW WWashington Pashington Pashington Pashington Pashington P ost ostost ostost\n“Raises profound and deeply troubling questions. ”\n— —— ——Cle CleCle CleCleveland Plain Dealerveland Plain Dealerveland Plain Dealerveland Plain Dealerveland Plain Dealer\n“Dallas journalist Marrs brings together under one cover\ndiverse theories and facts advanced in many of these works.\nHe points to the inconsistencies and unexplained elementsembodied in the official versions as to what transpired in Dallasbefore, during, and after the president’s death. “\n— —— ——Libr LibrLibr LibrLibrar arar arary Jour y Joury Jour y Joury Jour nal nalnal nalnal\n“For its comprehensiveness alone, this would be the one\nbook for anyone seeking a really thorough examination of the\nassassination. Marrs is sensible and straightforward, givingevery side of disputed questions, though it is clear that forhim, as for most thoughtful people, the Warren Commission’spicture of Oswald as a lone assassin doesn’t work. “\n— —— ——Pub PubPub PubPublisher lisherlisher lisherlisher s ss ssW WW WWeekl eekleekl eekleekly yy yy\nHigh Praise for Alien AlienAlien AlienAlien Agenda AgendaAgenda AgendaAgenda\n“The most entertaining and complete overview of flying\nsaucers and their crew published in years. ”\n— —— ——Pub PubPub PubPublisher lisherlisher lisherlisher s ss ssW WW WWeekl eekleekl eekleekly yy yy\n“You may find yourself watching the skies a little more in-\ntently , or even checking under the bed before you go to\nsleep. ”\n— —— ——Ft. F