saults,\nwhere ever you go, and perpetrated over months and years by strangers, is\nwhat dif ferentiates Gangstalking (also called or ganized stalking or cause\nstalking ) vs ordinary harassment.\n \nWhen one becomes a victim of Gangstalking or or ganized stalking, ones\nlife is changed completely . There is no way you can not know when you are\na victim of gangstalking and/or directed ener gy weapon harassment/V2K.\nYou are very deliberately made aware of it. The perpetrators express\narrogance and want to drive it home to you that they can lord it over you\nand get away with this.\n \nThe way these gangstalkers behave isn’ t consistent with human behavior .\nThis the reason why victims are not believed and given the stigmata of\nhaving a mental illness or delusions. Ganging up on a stranger in order to\nstalk and harass them every where they go, and by bizarre often childish\nmethods, would waste a lot of time and of fer little or no reward to a normal\nhuman being, who has a job, a home and a life to live.\n \nThe r eason that these gangstalkers behave as one gr oup stalker is\nbecause the individual looking bodies ar e actually dir ected and formed\nby one energetic entity . Thus the gangstalker forms, even childr en and\nelders, all behave similarly , identically even, and of course show the\nsame venomous attitude.\n \nThey do not come from the same source as authentic humans and have no\ndivine spark or potential to spiritually evolve via the heart Chakra, as we\ndo.\n \nThey are virtual demons taking human form. They work alongside the\nMasonic control system-with its police and mental health fusion centers- to\nuphold and help defend ideas and agenda’ s of the Master Builders by\ncontrolling principalities and behavior .\n \nAuthors note:\n \nI use occasionally the terms, “Gr ey’s”, and, “Reptilian’ s”, to r efer to what\nthe entities sometimes look like only . Anything that shape shifts its form, can\nnot be r elied on to be with 100% accuracy , what it looks like. Its mor e\neducational to examine what they do. IE: By their fruits ye shall know them.\n \nChapter 2\n \nWhere Do They Come From?\n \nThe realm that the shapeshifting entities come from is separated from this\none by the same thing that makes everything appear separate and dif ferent:\na difference in vibration at the molecular level. At the quantum level there\nare no edges, only changes in frequency , because everything is ener gy. It is\nonly changes in frequency or oscillation we perceive as edges or as\ndifferences.\n \nDifferent colors for example, at the molecular level, equate to slightly\ndifferent frequencies and chemistry .\n \nAs dif ferent realms are only so because they are dif ferent ener getic\nconstructions, so is anti-matter , and its relationship between time,\nconsciousness and perception to create a, “reality”, that we don’ t\nacknowledge.\n \nThe various hells and heavens are ener getic realms. There are seven\nheavens¹ ⁰  and an infinite number of hells.¹¹ I am including this information\nin order to make a subtle point, one which seems to be well understood by\nthe entity behind the shapeshifting gangstalkers:\n \non the stratum of per ceptive experiencing everything can exist because\neverything exists potentially but you have to make a connection with it,\nnotice it, or go ther e energetically , in order for it to exist. Only by the\nfocus of your per ception do you activate it and make it r eal.\n \nHumans have around 90 or so years of life, on average, in a body . As the\nentity behind the shapeshifters lives for thousands of years, it doesn’ t go\nback to the universal oneness (die) and so it remains cognizant of what\nwould be to us, many past lives that were lived in many previous bodies,\nbut in dif ferent time periods.\n \nAs they are not mortal and not constrained by form, they have the potential\nto be omnipresent.\n \nThe ener getic entity behind the shape shifted forms can be termed causals.\nThey cause or bring an ele