 he sat in very close proximity to the targeted victim at the table and leant towards her, \npresenting himself as if speaking to her in private. \nDuring this meeting Fraser Ellis MP stated the word, when talking about Government projects \n\"Labor\" \nFraser Ellis MP also stated the words : \n• \"How did that feel?  - Identified as words stated to the targeted victim in 2015 during \nExtreme Targeting involving Conspired isolation of the victim, Extreme Sexual targeting of the vic-\ntim and Conspired attempted murder by lethal injection of the victim, and stated to the victims \nface by Identified individual involved 2014-2015 Conspired Sexual Targeting involving Paul Gard-\nner, Port Germain, Queensland, and connected to Police sources involved, Motorcycle gang \nmembers involved and the targeted victims Business Advisor of a Intellectual Property Theft, Mi-\nchael Fetherstonhaugh  2006-2012 Medical Business Plan and M.S.I.C, connected to the Direct \ntargeting of Epstein and Maxwell (ADAM) and a Sex Abuse Ring targeting the targeted victim \n• \"Criticism\" - Word that would suggest Fraser ellis MP Involved in the constant and \nContinuous psychological abuse, vicious harassment of the targeted victim in her home con-\nducted through RF Transmissions \nBoth these statements were not pertained to any other form of the interaction involving the meet-\ning of a medical claim and gaining assistance and were spoken completely out of context by Fra-\nser Ellis MP, Kadina and suspiciously suspect of being personal \nEFTA00261520\nComment \"How Did that feel? Made by Fraser Ellis MP - Identified as Involved and present during \nthe 2013-2017 Conspired Attempted murder of the targeted victim by lethal injection, the Con-\nspired Extreme Sexual targeting of the targeted victim, Extreme Fraudulent activity involving \nMoney laundering from the targeted victim, Conspired Police targeting of the targeted victim, and \nMultiple Intellectual Property Theft, including the development of the Reality series manuscripts of \nthe targeted victim \nDuring this meeting Fraser Ellis MP Personal assistant GLARED at the targeted victim as if jeal-\nous or a distaste or disliking for the targeted victim \nSarah, Personal Assistant of Fraser Ellis MP was Identified as relaying messages for Fraser Ellis \nMP while he was at work entailing \"Tell her I love her\" -which Sarah was relaying to the targeted \nvictim for Fraser Ellis MP through RF Transmissions \nFraser Ellis MP, Kadina Govemment source Identified as Involved in the targeting of the targeted \nvictim and targeted Sex Crimes in Australia involving Epstein and Maxwell \nFraser Ellis MP, Kadina and Sarah informed the targeted victim during this meeting that it was \nadvisable for the targeted victim to write the claims herself for the medical negligence and did not \nassist the targeted victim in anyway involving the medical negligence claims, including the medi-\ncal negligence of the Wallaroo Hospital. \nFollowing this meeting RF Transmissions involving the manipulation, grooming and Conspired \nsexual targeting of the targeted victim involving the Ellis Family continued. During this period the \ntargeted victim suspicious of what the Ellis Family were saying was untrue, but instead believed \nthat they were trying to protect her from the targeting. The targeted victim kept stating \"I don't be-\nlieve you because there is no personal contact between us\" \nThe targeted victim was then contacted directly by Giles Ellis, Manager of the Kadina Sports and \nLeisure Centre - Who then proceeded to become involved in the manipulation, grooming of the \nvictim and Conspired Sexual targeting of the victim. - Email evidence / Refer to File 4 / 4B Giles \nEllis %20 \nPattern of Behaviour following this point - Manipulation - Grooming - Conspired Sexual Targeting \n• Fraser Ellis MP - Manipulating the targeted victim into becoming a house wife and getting \npregnant - having a child \n• Giles Ellis - Portraying a jealous who was fighting for the targeted victims hand in a \nrelationship \n• Giles Ellis - masturbating with the targeted victim through RF Transmissions \n• Giles Ellis stating he was the son in love with her \n• Michael Ellis - Stating Giles was the son in love with her \n• Teressa Ellis - Stating Giles was the son in love with her \n• Manipulation of marriage \n• Manipulation to change the targeted victim image to a wholesome house wife and \nimage \n• Fraser Ellis MP-Stating \"Trust Me\" \n• Fraser Ellis MP - Stating \"I did it because I care\" \n• Fraser Ellis MP - Stating \"Please Stay\" \n• Fraser Ellis MP - Stating \"This will never happen again\" \"I give you my word\" \n• Fraser Ellis MP - Stating \"I will never let you go\" \n• Fraser Ellis- Stating \"I won't stop until I have a ring on that finger\" \n• Fraser Ellis - Stating \"Everyone loves you here\" \n• Fraser Ellis MP - \"", "metadata": {"category": "mkultra_benchmark", "topic": "mind_control_research"}}
