roup and participants who would be interested in becoming guest speakers at group \nmeetings, which at this stage would be conducted once a month in rural and metropolitan locations. \nI was informed by Perry Celani of Cloud 9 Hypnotherapy who has agreed to be a part of this new development in this \nlocation that you expressed an interest in becoming a part of this venture. \nI am contacting you to schedule a meeting to discuss this with you in detail and gain your considered interest . \nCould you please contact me with an appropriate time that suits you to further discuss your interest. \nYour time and consideration would be greatly appreciated. \nKind Regards \nJacqueline Pearce \nShannon Reid \nTo: Jacqueline Pearce > \nHi Jacqueline, 14 August 2023 at 17:02 \nThank you for your email. I am more than happy to meet or complete a call to discuss this. I typically work Monday, \nTuesday and every second Friday. My Friday tends to be the day I have the most availability if that would suit you. I \ncan do this Friday, otherwise let me know when best suits you and I can see what I can make work. \nKind regards, \nShannon Reid \nCopper Coast Psychology \n46 George Street Moonta SA 5558 \ne-\n510445086261546384sqt=1 asimpl=msg-a:r221... 1/21 \nEFTA00262707\n1/26/24: 11:07 AM Gmail - Expression of interest - appointment \nFrom: Jacqueline Pearce I \nSent: Monday, August 14 2023 4:38 PM \nTo: Shannon Reid \nSubject: Expression of interest - appointment \nDear Shannon Reid, \nI would like to introduce myself, my name is Jacqueline Pearce. I have been a resident of Kadina for 3 years and have \na background in Business Development, Business Management and Administration and am currently developing a \ncommunity centre, commencing as a Non for Profit Organisation to support victims of crime, trauma, abuse and grief, \nand equipping the victims of these nature's with the support and life skills to rebuild their lives or gain support from \ntheir feelings of isolation or over