acting you to schedule a meeting to discuss this with you in detail and gain your considered interest . \nCould you please contact me with an appropriate time that suits you to further discuss your interest. \nYour time and consideration would be greatly appreciated. \nKind Regards \nJacqueline Pearce \nShannon Reid 15 August 2023 at 12:10 \nTo: Jacqueline Pe \nHi Jacqueline, \nLooking forward to it. \nWould you like to meet in the office or would you prefer to meet at a Café or something? \nThanks, \nShannon Reid \nCopper Coast Psychology \n46 George Street Moonta SA 5558 \ne-\nFrom: Jacqueline Pearce < \nSent: Tuesday, August 15, 2023 9:37 AM \n19445086261546384set=18simpl=msg-a:r221... 9,21 \nEFTA00262712\n1/26124. 11:07 AM Gmail - Expression of interest - appointment \nShannon Reid \nCopper Coast Psychology \n46 George Street Moonta SA 5558 \ne-\nFrom: Jacqueline Pearce <1 \nSent: Tuesday, August 15, 2021-Th257M \nTo: Shannon Reid < \nSubject: Re: Expression of interest - appointment \nI could meet you in your office as I would prefer to speak about the development in a Confidential environment if you \ndon't mind. \nI am seeking Expressions of interest regarding professionals at this stage to build the conjoined network and guest \nspeakers and as it's still in developmental stage I'm not quite ready to release details to the public as of yet. \nI will see you on Friday at 12pm in your office. \nKind Regards \nJacqueline \nOn Tue, 15 Aug 2023, 12:11 pm Shannon Reid, < > wrote: \nHi Jacqueline, \nLooking forward to it. \nWould you like to meet in the office or would you prefer to meet at a Café or something? \nThanks, \nShannon Reid \nCopper Coast Psychology \n46 George Street Moonta SA 5558 \ne-\n15721 \nEFTA00262713\nve-Katot.1 zs-5PV. s0toPoRT-\nFiettreatNYA mr_erwe., r11-} GOAN) OoN) RetZ, \nYou have the right to be you. You have the right to be heard. You have the right to be \nsupported. You are not alone - Do not suffer in silence or isolation - Do not suffer in fear or confusion or of being \nmisunderstood or not supported \nYour experiences are real -You feelings are real - You are not alone Do not feel alone \nShare your experiences with support and understanding. ISPY.SUPPORT was developed by a victim of \nTargeted Organised Crime and understands and supports your concerns and fears and is ready to listen \nand now reaches out to you with support and understanding. \nEmpower yourself, Embrace your courage and be the voice behind your own experience. \nISPY.SUPPORT - A support network of shared experiences. shared information, shared support and \nunderstanding. You do not have to be a victim. Be the survivor and fight this injustice of subjected fear. \ndeceit and inhumane practices injected and projected into our society and lives. \nISPY.SUPPORT a collective conjoined network of support for victims of Crime. Abuse, Trauma \nand Grief. \nISPY.SUPPORT is here for you. Jon Today. Guest Speakers of experienced professionals \ninvolving Abuse. Trauma and Grief counselling, experiences and support. Learn what you can do to \ntake the steps towards a better life, a better future, your future. \nLearn how to rebuild your life from the experiences of Abuse, Trauma and grief. \nFind the support you need. We care, you we not alone. do not suffer alone. do not suffer in silence. \nLEARN WHAT STEPS TO TAKE \nISPY.SUPPORT NETWORK - Guest Speakers - Conjoined Services - Volunteers \n• Cloud 9 Hypnotherapy - Moonta South Australia - Perry Celani - Hypnctherapist \nFrustration - Anxiety • Emotions - Grief - Stress management - Depression - Chronic Pain - \nWeight management - Empath (---• Copper Coast Psychology - Moonta South Australia - Shannon Reid - Depressive Disorders \nAnxiety Disorders - Adjustment Disorders - Stress Management - Anger Management \nSelf -harm behaviors and suicidal thinking - Grief - Emotional Regulation • Trauma Disorders \n\\\\I \n• Country Fire Service - CFS - Region 2 - Yorke Peninsula - Daniel Bam